<p>引入 Cef 后程序体积增加 347 MB（x64 和 x86 各占一半）</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Automapper 学习笔记</title><link>https://blog.frhello.com/automapper-%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2020 23:35:38 +0800</pubDate><author>作者</author><guid>https://blog.frhello.com/automapper-%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>本文基于 Automapper 9.0.0</p>
<h2 id="诊断-automapper-的属性映射过程">诊断 Automapper 的属性映射过程</h2>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span><span class="lnt">5
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-csharp" data-lang="csharp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">var</span> <span class="n">cfg</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="k">new</span> <span class="n">MapperConfigurationExpression</span><span class="p">();</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">cfg</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">CreateMap</span><span class="p">&lt;</span><span class="n">TypeB</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">TypeA</span><span class="p">&gt;();</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">var</span> <span class="n">configuration</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="k">new</span> <span class="n">MapperConfiguration</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">cfg</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">var</span> <span class="n">executionPlan</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="n">configuration</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">BuildExecutionPlan</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="k">typeof</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">TypeB</span><span class="p">),</span> <span class="k">typeof</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">TypeA</span><span class="p">));</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>最关键的一行代码 <code>var executionPlan = configuration.BuildExecutionPlan(typeof(TypeB), typeof(TypeA));</code>，此时查看 <code>executionPlan</code> 可以看到它对应的表达式树解析，看到属性如何映射。这里有个小技巧，安装 Visual Studio 插件 <a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=vs-publisher-1232914.ReadableExpressionsVisualizers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer">ReadableExpressions VS extension</a> 可以更清晰的看到表达式树解析。需要注意应该在正式发布时移除所有的调试代码。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>CentOS 部署 .NetCore 服务</title><link>https://blog.frhello.com/centos-%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-.netcore-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Mar 2018 09:09:42 +0800</pubDate><author>作者</author><guid>https://blog.frhello.com/centos-%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-.netcore-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="安装-centos可使用最小安装包镜像">安装 CentOs，可使用最小安装包镜像</h2>
<p><a href="http://isoredirect.centos.org/centos/7/isos/x86_64/CentOS-7-x86_64-Minimal-1708.iso" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer">http://isoredirect.centos.org/centos/7/isos/x86_64/CentOS-7-x86_64-Minimal-1708.iso</a></p>
<h2 id="跟随安装步骤进行中途要选择磁盘">跟随安装步骤进行，中途要选择磁盘</h2>
<p><figure><a class="lightgallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fengrui358/img@main/282687-20180309232456524-101259708.png" title="选择磁盘" data-thumbnail="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fengrui358/img@main/282687-20180309232456524-101259708.png" data-sub-html="<h2>选择磁盘</h2><p>选择磁盘</p>">
        
    </a><figcaption class="image-caption">选择磁盘</figcaption>
    </figure></p>
<h2 id="设置-root-用户密码">设置 Root 用户密码</h2>
<p><figure><a class="lightgallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fengrui358/img@main/282687-20180309232643970-959574733.png" title="设置 Root 用户密码" data-thumbnail="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fengrui358/img@main/282687-20180309232643970-959574733.png" data-sub-html="<h2>设置 Root 用户密码</h2><p>设置 Root 用户密码</p>]]></description></item><item><title>C# 为何不推荐在构造函数中访问虚成员</title><link>https://blog.frhello.com/csharp%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E5%9C%A8%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E8%99%9A%E6%88%90%E5%91%98/</link><pubDate>Sat, 03 Jun 2017 23:25:19 +0800</pubDate><author>作者</author><guid>https://blog.frhello.com/csharp%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E5%9C%A8%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E8%99%9A%E6%88%90%E5%91%98/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><figure><a class="lightgallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fengrui358/img@main/282687-20170603231748899-1742988080.png" title="警告" data-thumbnail="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fengrui358/img@main/282687-20170603231748899-1742988080.png" data-sub-html="<h2>警告</h2><p>警告</p>">
        
    </a><figcaption class="image-caption">警告</figcaption>
